79</idno><idno type="APIS">3745</idno></person><person xml:id="person3786"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rngog blo ldan shes rab</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རྔོག་བློ་ལྡན་ཤེས་རབ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rngog lo tsA ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lo chen</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge slong blo ldan shes rab</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rngog lo rtsa ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rngog dge slong blo ldan shes rab</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo ldan bzang po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lo tsha ba chen po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lo ts+tsha ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lo tsha ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lo tsa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rngog</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">blo ldan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">ma hA</persName><birth notBefore="1059-01-01" notAfter="1059-12-31">1059</birth><death notBefore="1109-01-01" notAfter="1109-12-31">1109</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2551</idno><idno type="APIS">3786</idno><note type="comment">See [BAQ9MH4T]: 193 for the main events of his life.&#13;
