         <ab>
            <gap reason="omitted"/><lb edRef="inst:5150" n="5a6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex066052026-07-0711-10-41" status="reviewed">yang <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3834">ston rgya</rs> swo kha 1 na re ¦ byang chub <expan>sems dpa'i</expan> bslab pa <expan>thams cad</expan> phar phyin drug du 'dus la de <expan>thams cad</expan> la blang dor ma <lb edRef="inst:5150" n="5a7"/> nor bar byed pa thun mong gi yan lag bag<note type="gloss">"bag" unclear, maybe "can"?</note> yod pas bstan to || 
            shes <expan>bzhin</expan> gyis tshul khrims bstan cing bzod pa swo 4 ni rang rang gi le'us bstan pas phar phyin lnga dang sbyin pa ni <expan>sems skyed</expan> dang shes <expan>bzhin</expan> le'ur bshad pas logs su ma smos la ¦ thabs swos dang ni sher phyir du 'dus pa'i phyir <choice><corr>phar</corr><sic>phan</sic></choice> phyin drug las gzhan med zer ba ni legs so || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/></ab>
         
