            <lb n="7b3"/><pb n="15"/><lb edRef="inst:5150" n="8a7"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex066052026-07-0711-19-04" status="reviewed">2 pa mtshan nyid mi 'gro bar ces pas ston pa la 3 las 
            <milestone n="gzhan lugs dgag pa" unit="section"/>
            gzhan lugs dgag pa ni 
            <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3786">lo tsha ba</rs> na re ¦ bden 2 kyi <expan>byang chub</expan> mngon du <lb edRef="inst:5150" n="8a8"/> ma gyur par so so skye'i dus na gzhan don du byang chub 'dod pa tsam brda las byung pa ni smon pa'i sems yin la byang chub mngon du gyur pa sa dang po yan chod chos nyid kyis thob pa'i sems <choice><reg>ni 'jug pa'i sems</reg><orig>‹ni 'jug pa'i sems›</orig></choice> yin zer ba mi 'thad te ¦ 
            <quote><lg><l>'jug sems cho ga la mi ltos na ¦</l> <l>sems de yang dag blangs gyur pa ¦</l></lg></quote> ces bstan pa dang 'gal ¦ 
            yang <rs type="work" ref="work:3742" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">bslab bstus</rs> su ci sar ma chud pa la yang byang chub pa <pb n="16"/>
            <lb edRef="inst:5150" n="8b1"/> dbang du bya ba yod dam med ces bya ba 'di brjod par bya'o ce na ¦ 
            <quote>yod par rig par bya ste ¦</quote> ces 'jug sdom so skye la yod par bshad pa dag 'gal la | </seg><gap reason="omitted"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex066052026-07-0710-19-45" status="reviewed">yang <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="person:3834">stod rgya</rs> swo <note type="gloss">kha 1</note> na re | ched du bya ba gzhan don <expan>'bras bu</expan> <expan>byang chub chen</expan><note type="editorial">Reading uncertain</note> × la dmigs pa'i bsam pa ni smon pa bsam pa ¦ bsam pa de nyid bsgrub pas zin pa'i cha 'jug pa ¦ des kun <lb edRef="inst:5150" n="8b3"/> ° spyod pa nyams su len pa ni <expan>byang chub</expan> sems kyi bslab pa yin zer ba mi 'thad de ¦ 'jug sems cho ga la mi ltos par 'gyur ste × cho ga ma byas pa'i sngar bsam pa de nyid bsgrub pas zin pa srid pa'i phyir ro || yang 'jug pa dang bslab pa tha dad du mi 'thad de | blang ngor ma nor ba la 'jug pa las byang sems kyi bslab pa gzhan <lb edRef="inst:5150" n="8b4"/> <choice><reg>pa'i</reg><orig>°'i</orig></choice> phyir ro ||</seg> 
